[00:15.30]1. Who is like you, O Jehovah,
[00:22.24]High on your heavenly throne?
[00:28.96]How could I ever repay you
[00:34.64]For all of the love you have shown?
[00:42.86]When I look up to the heavens,
[00:48.38]Power and glory I see.
[00:56.54]Who then am I, O Jehovah,
[01:02.26]That you would show favor to me?
[01:08.00](Chorus)
[01:08.66]Jehovah God, please hear the song I sing.
[01:15.64]It’s a song of praise to you.
[01:21.52]You are my God and the Eternal King,
[01:29.18]So I give you what is due;
[01:36.42]All the glory goes to you.
[01:47.01]2. My life is yours, O Jehovah.
[01:54.79]May all I do bring you praise.
[02:01.69]Gladly I’ll speak of your goodness
[02:07.03]And tell of your glorious ways.
[02:15.55]Serving you, Great God, Jehovah,
[02:21.35]Fills me with honor and pride.
[02:28.95]You are my strength and my glory.
[02:36.13]Forever may you be my Guide.
[02:40.69](Chorus)
[02:41.05]Jehovah God, please hear the song I sing.
[02:48.31]It’s a song of praise to you.
[02:54.29]You are my God and the Eternal King,
[03:02.31]So I give you what is due;
[03:09.01]All the glory goes to you.
[03:20.27]3. Oceans and valleys below me,
[03:27.35]Sun, moon, and stars up above
[03:33.25]Fill me with joy and with wonder
[03:39.95]And show me your unending love.
[03:48.51]Majesty, wisdom, and beauty:
[03:54.71]These are the things that I see.
[04:00.57]How could I not give you glory
[04:07.05]For making it all come to be?
[04:13.33](Chorus)
[04:13.51]Jehovah God, please hear the song I sing.
[04:21.07]It’s a song of praise to you.
[04:27.09]You are my God and the Eternal King,
[04:34.27]So I give you what is due;
[04:41.33]All the glory goes to you.
